Integration solution between Power Apps and Nav on premises system

Applies to: Dynamics 365 Customer Engagement, Dynamics 365 Sales, On-Premises Nav system, Power Automate, Power Apps, Dataverse, Azure Logic Apps, Azure Functions, Azure Key Vault, Azure Active Directory, Azure Application Insights, Custom Connectors, On-Premises Data Gateway to establish a real-time processing of messages/data from/to the device.
This solution integrates Canvas App, Dataverse, Power Automate, Azure Service Bus, Azure Key Vault, Azure Logic App and Application Insights to establish a robust mechanism for transmitting messages/data from Canvas App to on-premises Nav system or vice versa.
This pattern can be scaled up to increase the number of devices for real-time processing. The pattern ensures that the solution is resilient, robust, secured, performant, scalable, consistent and monitoring, error management, retries are built in.
Introduction
Dynamics often requires connecting to on-premises Nav system. The purpose of this solution is to bring efficiency in processing data and information across the various operational departments within the organisation and to replace many of the disparate software solutions.
This Integration solution helps with seamless processing between Canvas App and on-premises Nav system.  Maintains data consistency between Dataverse and on premises Nav system by coordinating transactions across multiple services. This approach provides a centralized system for unique customer experience. 
